    "https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc9110  (IETF datatracker mirror of RFC 9110; HTTP/2 200)",
    "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Headers/Vary  (MDN developer reference, redirects from legacy /docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Vary; HTTP/2 200)",
    "https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9111.html#section-4.1  (RFC 9111 \u00a74.1 - cache-key calculation with Vary; HTTP/2 200)"
  ],
  "name_probes": [
    "https://pypi.org/pypi/vary-parse/json  (HTTP/2 404 - name free on PyPI, verified 2026-09-27)",
